# No AI commit / PR attribution

Pricing App does not keep AI attribution in git history or pull request bodies.

## Do not

- Add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` (or any `Co-authored-by` for an AI / agent).
- Pass `git commit --trailer "Co-authored-by: Cursor ..."`.
- Put "Made with Cursor" (or equivalent) in PR bodies, commit messages, or commit trailers.

## Do

- Use normal Conventional Commit messages only.
- If a tool injects an AI trailer, strip it before push.

This matches team review policy: human-authored history, no agent co-author trailers.
